  <Docs>
    <summary>Represents a ranging device identified by a unique UUID.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Represents a ranging device identified by a unique UUID.</para>
      <para>This class is designed for ranging operations, where each device involved in the ranging
            session is uniquely identified by a <c>UUID</c>.</para>
